  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>As we know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mtext>&#160;for&#160;</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi